cy. If you do not agree, please do not use or access the Platform.\"}]]]}],[\"$\",\"section\",\"Collection\",{\"className\":\"flex flex-col gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"font-heading text-xl font-bold text-foreground\",\"children\":\"Collection\"}],[[\"$\",\"p\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"whitespace-pre-line text-pretty leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground\",\"children\":\"$4\"}]]]}],\"$L5\",\"$L6\",\"$L7\",\"$L8\",\"$L9\",\"$La\",\"$Lb\",\"$Lc\"]}]]}]}]}],[\"$Ld\"],\"$Le\"]}],\"isPartial\":\"$@f\",\"staleTime\":\"$10\",\"varyParams\":null},{\"rsc\":\"$L11\",\"isPartial\":\"$@12\",\"staleTime\":\"$10\",\"varyParams\":null},{\"rsc\":\"$L13\",\"isPartial\":\"$@14\",\"staleTime\":\"$10\",\"varyParams\":\"$15\"}],\"isUpgradeableISRFallback\":false,\"a\":\"$@16\",\"rootVaryParams\":null,\"needsRuntimeRequest\":\"$@17\"}\n18:I[97367,[\"/_next/static/chunks/1q1-17_3ay0jy.js\"],\"OutletBoundary\"]\n19:\"$Sreact.suspense\"\n1b:I[97367,[\"/_next/static/chunks/1q1-17_3ay0jy.js\"],\"ViewportBoundary\"]\n1c:I[97367,[\"/_next/static/chunks/1q1-17_3ay0jy.js\"],\"MetadataBoundary\"]\n1d:I[27201,[\"/_next/static/chunks/1q1-17_3ay0jy.js\"],\"IconMark\"]\n1e:I[39756,[\"/_next/static/chunks/1q1-17_3ay0jy.js\"],\"default\"]\n1f:I[37457,[\"/_next/static/chunks/1q1-17_3ay0jy.js\"],\"default\"]\n5:[\"$\",\"section\",\"Usage\",{\"className\":\"flex flex-col gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"font-heading text-xl font-bold text-foreground\",\"children\":\"Usage\"}],[[\"$\",\"p\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"whitespace-pre-line text-pretty leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground\",\"children\":\"We use personal data to provide the services you request, assist with handling and fulfilling orders, enhance customer experience, resolve disputes, troubleshoot problems, inform you about offers, products, services and updates, customise your experience, detect and protect against error, fraud and other criminal activity, enforce our terms and conditions, conduct marketing research, analysis and surveys, and as otherwise described to you at the time of collection of information.\"}]]]}]\n6:[\"$\",\"section\",\"Sharing\",{\"className\":\"flex flex-col gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"font-heading text-xl font-bold text-foreground\",\"children\":\"Sharing\"}],[[\"$\",\"p\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"whitespace-pre-line text-pretty leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground\",\"children\":\"We may disclose personal data to third parties such as logistics partners, payment service providers, technology providers and other service providers where required to provide our services. We may also disclose personal data to government agencies or authorised law enforcement agencies when required by law or where reasonably necessary to comply with legal process, enforce our terms, prevent fraud or protect the rights, property or personal safety of our users or the general public.\"}]]]}]\n7:[\"$\",\"section\",\"Security Precautions\",{\"className\":\"flex flex-col gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"font-heading text-xl font-bold text-foreground\",\"children\":\"Security Precautions\"}],[[\"$\",\"p\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"whitespace-pre-line text-pretty leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground\",\"children\":\"To protect your personal data from unauthorised access or disclosure, loss or misuse, we adopt reasonable security practices and procedures. However, transmission of information over the internet is not completely secure and users acknowledge the inherent risks of data transmission over the internet and World Wide Web.\"}]]]}]\n8:[\"$\",\"section\",\"Data Deletion and Retention\",{\"className\":\"flex flex-col gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"font-heading text-xl font-bold text-foreground\",\"children\":\"Data Deletion and Retention\"}],[[\"$\",\"p\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"whitespace-pre-line text-pretty leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground\",\"children\":\"You may write to us at swadamfoodsindia@gmail.com to request assistance with deletion or other data-related requests. We may refuse or delay deletion where there are pending grievances, claims, pending shipments or other legitimate reasons. We retain personal data for no longer than required for the purpose for which it was collected or as required under applicable law. We may retain data where necessary to prevent fraud or future abuse or for other legitimate purposes and may continue to retain anonymised data for analytical and research purposes.\"}]]]}]\n9:[\"$\",\"section\",\"Your Rights\",{\"className\":\"flex flex-col gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"font-heading text-xl font-bold text-foreground\",\"children\":\"Your Rights\"}],[[\"$\",\"p\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"whitespace-pre-line text-pretty leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground\",\"children\":\"You may request access to, rectification of, or updates to your personal data by contacting us using the contact details below, subject to applicable law.\"}]]]}]\na:[\"$\",\"section\",\"Consent\",{\"className\":\"flex flex-col gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"font-heading text-xl font-bold text-foreground\",\"children\":\"Consent\"}],[[\"$\",\"p\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"whitespace-pre-line text-pretty leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground\",\"children\":\"By visiting our Platform or providing your information, you consent to the collection, use, storage, disclosure and otherwise processing of your information on the Platform in accordance with this Privacy Policy. You may withdraw consent by writing to us at swadamfoodsindia@gmail.com. Please note that withdrawal of consent will not be retrospective and may restrict or prevent us from providing services for which the information is necessary.\"}]]]}]\nb:[\"$\",\"section\",\"Changes to this Privacy Policy\",{\"className\":\"flex flex-col gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"font-heading text-xl font-bold text-foreground\",\"children\":\"Changes to this Privacy Policy\"}],[[\"$\",\"p\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"whitespace-pre-line text-pretty leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground\",\"children\":\"Please check this Privacy Policy periodically for changes. We may update this Privacy Policy to reflect changes to our information practices and may notify you about significant changes in the manner required by applicable laws.\"}]]]}]\nc:[\"$\",\"section\",\"Grievance Officer\",{\"className\":\"flex flex-col gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"font-heading text-xl font-bold text-foreground\",\"children\":\"Grievance Officer\"}],[[\"$\",\"p\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"whitespace-pre-line text-pretty leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground\",\"children\":\"Swadam Foods\\nLane No. 30/31 B, Ganesh Nagar, Dhayari, Pune\\nEmail: swadamfoodsindia@gmail.com\\nPhone: +91 88888 51522\\nTime: Monday - Friday (9:00 - 18:00)\"}]]]}]\nd:[\"$\",\"script\",\"script-0\",{\"src\":\"/_next/static/chunks/3zjsxf0yaxvfu.js\",\"async\":true}]\ne:[\"$\",\"$L18\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$19\",null,{\"name\":\"Next.MetadataOutlet\",\"children\":\"$@1a\"}]}]\n11:[\"$\",\"$1\",\"h\",{\"children\":[null,[\"$\",\"$L1b\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"meta\",\"0\",{\"charSet\":\"utf-8\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"viewport\",\"content\":\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"2\",{\"name\":\"theme-color\",\"content\":\"#f7f2e7\",\"media\":\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"3\",{\"name\":\"theme-color\",\"content\":\"#25201a\",\"media\":\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"hidden\":true,\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L1c\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$19\",null,{\"name\":\"Next.Metadata\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"title\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"Privacy Policy | Swadam Foods\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"description\",\"content\":\"Privacy Policy governing how Swadam Foods collects, uses, shares and protects personal data.